    "detailed_description": "<h1>Kickstarter Coming Soon</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/be163b156348eac26811b92ddf0fbebe.avif?t=1750242783\" data-has-big width=800 height=178 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Little Chef 2</i></strong> invites you back into the kitchen for a delightful cooking adventure filled with <strong>cozy vibes</strong> and <strong>whimsical fu</strong>n! Whether you're a seasoned chef or just here for the laughs, this adorable sequel brings joy to every dish you create!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHYSICS BASED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/1d85c7916f955b2acabed46b1313a6c9.poster.avif?t=1750242783\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/1d85c7916f955b2acabed46b1313a6c9.webm?t=1750242783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy physics-based interactions as you unleash your creativity across a variety of kitchens and charming settings. Grab ingredients and objects from the scene and toss them around at your will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVER 150 UNIQUE DISHES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/46f1e54bebc4e2d79363a2feacdf33fe.poster.avif?t=1750242783\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/46f1e54bebc4e2d79363a2feacdf33fe.webm?t=1750242783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter what you end up cooking, a huge variety of possible dishes make every ingredient count and allow you to throw anything into the pot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUTE &amp; HIDDEN INTERACTIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/7d150ebc32edcc1f98b98edf34d68592.poster.avif?t=1750242783\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/7d150ebc32edcc1f98b98edf34d68592.webm?t=1750242783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click around in the different hand illustrated scenes to find out what cute little easter eggs and quirky interactions await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THREE DISTINCT KITCHENS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/89b0b4d166336ea4722e6ae384a9aa25.poster.avif?t=1750242783\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/89b0b4d166336ea4722e6ae384a9aa25.webp?t=1750242783\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock three different hand crafted kitchens which all offer their own new ingredients and ways of cooking, making sure you never end up cooking the same things again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/1e1004a449e0d162ef644efe068fd719.poster.avif?t=1750242783\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/1e1004a449e0d162ef644efe068fd719.webm?t=1750242783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Little Chef 2</i></strong> invites you back into the kitchen for a delightful cooking adventure filled with <strong>cozy vibes</strong> and <strong>whimsical fu</strong>n! Whether you're a seasoned chef or just here for the laughs, this adorable sequel brings joy to every dish you create!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHYSICS BASED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/1d85c7916f955b2acabed46b1313a6c9.poster.avif?t=1750242783\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/1d85c7916f955b2acabed46b1313a6c9.webm?t=1750242783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy physics-based interactions as you unleash your creativity across a variety of kitchens and charming settings. Grab ingredients and objects from the scene and toss them around at your will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVER 150 UNIQUE DISHES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/46f1e54bebc4e2d79363a2feacdf33fe.poster.avif?t=1750242783\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/46f1e54bebc4e2d79363a2feacdf33fe.webm?t=1750242783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter what you end up cooking, a huge variety of possible dishes make every ingredient count and allow you to throw anything into the pot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUTE &amp; HIDDEN INTERACTIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/7d150ebc32edcc1f98b98edf34d68592.poster.avif?t=1750242783\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/7d150ebc32edcc1f98b98edf34d68592.webm?t=1750242783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click around in the different hand illustrated scenes to find out what cute little easter eggs and quirky interactions await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THREE DISTINCT KITCHENS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/89b0b4d166336ea4722e6ae384a9aa25.poster.avif?t=1750242783\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/89b0b4d166336ea4722e6ae384a9aa25.webp?t=1750242783\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock three different hand crafted kitchens which all offer their own new ingredients and ways of cooking, making sure you never end up cooking the same things again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/1e1004a449e0d162ef644efe068fd719.poster.avif?t=1750242783\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376500/extras/1e1004a449e0d162ef644efe068fd719.webm?t=1750242783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Little Chef 2 is a physics-based cooking game that puts a lot of heart into discovery and exploration. You can interact with pretty much anything and either create pure chaos or try your luck at unlocking all ~160 recipes and becoming a master chef!",
